[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3929716726","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116501#issuecomment-3929716726","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116501","id":3929716726,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qOrf2","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-19T20:16:08Z","updated_at":"2026-02-19T20:16:08Z","body":"Did you test to ensure that this doesn't break canvas groups? ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3929716726/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3929798051","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116501#issuecomment-3929798051","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116501","id":3929798051,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qO_Wj","user":{"login":"mooflu","id":693717,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzcxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/693717?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu","html_url":"https://github.com/mooflu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-19T20:28:39Z","updated_at":"2026-02-19T20:28:39Z","body":"> Did you test to ensure that this doesn't break canvas groups?\r\n\r\nNo. I'll do some canvas groups tests later, but can't see how it could break, unless there are explicit set_color calls I missed.\r\n\r\nAFAICT the changed code in `TextureStorage::render_target_clear_back_buffer` is never executed because the only time it's called is here https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/drivers/gles3/rasterizer_canvas_gles3.cpp#L481 with an empty rect.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3929798051/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3930989581","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116501#issuecomment-3930989581","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116501","id":3930989581,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qTiQN","user":{"login":"mooflu","id":693717,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzcxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/693717?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu","html_url":"https://github.com/mooflu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-20T00:59:42Z","updated_at":"2026-02-20T00:59:42Z","body":"As expected I don't see anything broken with canvas groups. \r\nThat said, the `else` section in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/drivers/gles3/storage/texture_storage.cpp#L3707 isn't working with or without my code. Running a shader that sets a color isn't equivalent to `glClear` in the `if` part as `glClear` ignores blend modes, etc. \r\n\r\nIf I force it into the `else` code with\r\n```\r\n+       Rect2i region2(rt->position, rt->size);\r\n        Rect2i region;\r\n-       if (p_region == Rect2i()) {\r\n+       if (region2 == Rect2i()) {\r\n```\r\nand disable blend: \r\n```\r\n\t\tGLboolean blendEnabled = glIsEnabled(GL_BLEND);\r\n\t\tglDisable(GL_BLEND);\r\n\t\tglBindFramebuffer(GL_FRAMEBUFFER, rt->backbuffer_fbo);\r\n\t\t// set_color takes normalized rect (0..1)\r\n\t\tRect2 norm_rect = Rect2(Vector2(region.position) / Vector2(rt->size), Vector2(region.size) / Vector2(rt->size));\r\n\t\tGLES3::CopyEffects::get_singleton()->set_color(p_color, norm_rect);\r\n\t\tblendEnabled ? glEnable(GL_BLEND) : glDisable(GL_BLEND);\r\n```\r\nthen it works.\r\nAlternatively, instead of a shader, couldn't it use glClear with a scissor test? I.e.:\r\n```\r\n\t\tglBindFramebuffer(GL_FRAMEBUFFER, rt->backbuffer_fbo);\r\n\t\tglClearColor(p_color.r, p_color.g, p_color.b, p_color.a);\r\n\t\tglEnable(GL_SCISSOR_TEST);\r\n\t\tglScissor(region.position.x, region.position.y, region.size.width, region.size.height);\r\n\t\tglClear(GL_COLOR_BUFFER_BIT);\r\n\t\tglDisable(GL_SCISSOR_TEST);\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3930989581/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3939886828","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116501#issuecomment-3939886828","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116501","id":3939886828,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7q1ebs","user":{"login":"mooflu","id":693717,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzcxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/693717?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu","html_url":"https://github.com/mooflu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-22T01:33:16Z","updated_at":"2026-02-22T01:33:16Z","body":"Another option would be to change `void GLES3::TextureStorage::render_target_clear_back_buffer(RID p_render_target, const Rect2i & p_region, const Color & p_color)` to not take a region and color but then it would diverge from `void RendererRD::TextureStorage::render_target_clear_back_buffer(RID p_render_target, const Rect2i & p_region, const Color & p_color)`. Not sure if that's important.\r\n\r\n`glScissor` approach or removing params seem the best options to me.\r\n\r\n@clayjohn let me know what you think.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3939886828/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]